@*
    Login-only layout — used by /admin/login (plan 03-09) and the first-admin-missing state.

    UI-SPEC §1 "Admin login page": centered card on blank bg; no top nav, no sidebar, no brand
    chrome. The layout is a blank shell so the login form can own the full viewport.

    Dialog/snackbar providers are mounted here too so inline alerts from the sign-in flow
    (rate-limit warnings, 5xx errors) render correctly without dragging in the MainLayout's
    top nav or drawer.
*@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* Plan 03.1-08 — kept MudBlazor providers (theme + dialog + snackbar) for parity with
   MainLayout; the static-SSR Login page itself uses no MudBlazor components but providers
   in scope are harmless and preserve theme tokens. .gk-login-viewport / .gk-login-card
   styling lives in LoginLayout.razor.css and uses violet-aware --accent / --bg / --surface
   tokens from gamekit-admin.css. *@
<MudThemeProvider Theme="@GameKitAdminTheme.Default" />
<MudPopoverProvider />
<MudDialogProvider />
<MudSnackbarProvider />

<div class="gk-login-viewport">
    <div class="gk-login-card">
        @Body
    </div>
</div>
